{"seq":21,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-03-quarrendon-seat-count/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T10:54:19.336Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"0b781d8cf8bea9dd73c835871dd21a444ca6540aeb88356f9efbe2eb5ff4b709","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0002","text":"Hi Ilse, it's 185 seats. In #north-team on 20 Aug 2025, Dana first posted that Amendment No. 1 (signed 19 Aug 2025) took Quarrendon Freight Lines to 180 seats. Three minutes later she corrected it: \"It's 185, not 180.\" So if you see 180 anywhere, it's the typo. I couldn't find the signed amendment in the shared files, so this comes from Dana's correction, not the document. June should have the signed copy if you want to check it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0002","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
